// The privileged helper daemon's name in this configuration. The app, the Catalyst helper and the
// daemon target (Configurations/LaunchDaemon) all include this file, so the name is written once:
//
// - the daemon's PRODUCT_NAME, and the file name the app embeds under Contents/Library/LaunchServices;
// - the build-time-generated launchd plist (Label / MachServices) and the app Info.plist
//   RuntimeViewerServiceName key. At runtime RuntimeViewerMachServiceName reads it back: launchd env
//   for the daemon, Info.plist for the app;
// - the Catalyst helper's own copy, which must match the app's: the helper reaches the app through
//   the daemon of that name, and a helper on another daemon never finds the app's endpoint.
//
// A new configuration needs a file of its own here, included by all three.
RUNTIME_VIEWER_SERVICE_NAME = dev.mxiris.runtimeviewer.service
